{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670670/extras/080f6af3cc03cd660e8b023f58313c9f.avif?t=1768143554\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670670/extras_big/080f6af3cc03cd660e8b023f58313c9f.avif?t=1768143554 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wizzo Popout</strong> is a fast-paced 3D <strong>top-down arena shooter</strong> for up to 4 players.  Cast cool spells, dodge enemy blasts, and knock your rivals out of the arena in hilariously <strong>chaotic battles</strong>. Play as an arcane wizzo riding a bouncing magical bubble! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670670/extras/0a4d51e86797152cdbbb1f76a7c1b070.webp?t=1768143554\" width=434 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670670/extras/879d6d02429dae60a410c1cd555c08d0.avif?t=1768143554\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670670/extras_big/879d6d02429dae60a410c1cd555c08d0.avif?t=1768143554 width=800 height=241 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on the hat of a magical, mystical wizzo and show off your <strong>bubble</strong> <strong>blowing skills</strong> against your friends. <strong>Damage</strong> your opponents, but watch out: The higher the damage, the more you'll be <strong>knocked back</strong>! Impress with sickening <strong>flicks</strong> or precicse remote <strong>detonations</strong>. Play your opponents <strong>dizzy</strong>\u00a0with the power of the <strong>dash</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670670/extras/7d329293a369d659749ed051743e9242.webp?t=1768143554\" width=434 height=60 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outplay your friends in quick and intense, blood rushing battles for <strong>2-4 players</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: To ruin friendships you need friends to begin with.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670670/extras/2bf08d34b35eb13c31577fb2b4728bc1.avif?t=1768143554\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670670/extras_big/2bf08d34b35eb13c31577fb2b4728bc1.avif?t=1768143554 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670670/extras/c591c8e724a442ffc21d5438a3ac9c80.webp?t=1768143554\" width=434 height=60 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve World Domination in <strong>Online-Multiplayer</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easily create a lobby and invite your friends to play from <strong>anywhere.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670670/extras/48dadcb6f1cd492d7c2e71de8ae0e3d4.avif?t=1768143554\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670670/extras_big/48dadcb6f1cd492d7c2e71de8ae0e3d4.avif?t=1768143554 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_c